WEBVTT

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.070
WORLD HISTORY

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.330
<i>Ms. Kirisu...</i>

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.250
<i>Why is she sitting outside
her apartment on a hot day like this?</i>

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.630
Hello, please have a nice day...

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:11.520
EPISODE 9:
HE STRUGGLES WITH X
IN A FORBIDDEN ZONE

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:18.450
How could this place become
a disaster area so soon after we cleaned it?

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.530
I-It's vexing.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:23.990
Still, I have been putting
more effort into cleaning than before.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.090
Um... Why did you drag me in here?

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.510
Th-That insect appeared.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.680
"That insect"?

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:50.730
Oh, a cockr-

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.100
No!
Impermissible!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.400
Do not say that name!

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.400
O-Okay.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.900
So you just want me
to kill it, right?

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.450
Hey! Ms. Kirisu!

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.290
I can't kill it
if you don't let go of me!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.330
LEMON WATER

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.920
I-It got away.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:21.840
<i>But how scared is she
of some bug?</i>

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.900
Now it's clean again.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.820
From now on, it's your
responsibility to keep it this way.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.940
Naturally.
That's what I intend to do.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.490
Where have I heard that before?

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.620
Well, I'll be on my way.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:50.540
Wait!

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:55.840
Um...

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:59.510
I still don't know
where that thing is hiding.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:03.840
I'll do anything.
Just don't leave me alone.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.260
Anything?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:19.150
<i>Studying is much easier
when I have Ms. Kirisu looking on.</i>

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.950
<i>In the end,
this has turned out all right.</i>

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.660
After winning the Battle of Austerlitz,

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.370
Napoleon formed the Confederation
of the Rhine in Germany...

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.160
Sorry.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.210
I've already ordered food
to be delivered for dinner,

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.420
so eat here before you go.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.420
Oh, I couldn't...

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.880
It should be here shortly.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.380
Speak of the devil...

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.840
I'll get it.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.430
Coming!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.790
<i>Um, why is this happening?</i>

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.290
Your apartment is so clean.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.960
<i>Don't you need
to get back to work, Ogata?</i>

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.790
Oh, thank you.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.500
<i>I'm the one who cleaned it...</i>

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:25.130
<i>And wait,
when did she change clothes?</i>

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.560
<i>She's staring daggers at me!</i>

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.640
<i>What is it?
What does she want me to do?!</i>

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:34.810
<i>Is it that?</i>

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:39.150
<i>Maybe she doesn't like me
being with her archenemy teacher?</i>

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.980
<i>I'll honestly explain the circumstances...</i>

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.820
<i>No?
No, I guess I can't.</i>

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.450
<i>If it were known
she's afraid of roaches,</i>

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.110
<i>she'd lose dignity as a teacher.</i>

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.660
<i>What is this situation?</i>

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:56.000
<i>It's like oil and water,
with me in the middle!</i>

00:05:56.290 --> 00:06:00.460
<i>Or, wait... Maybe this is a chance
for them to bury the hatchet!</i>

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:04.710
Hey, Ogata, do you have
one of your games on you, like usual?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:08.090
W-Well, several of them...

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:12.470
<i>All right! If we play a game here,
the friendly atmosphere</i>

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.100
<i>will break the ice between them!</i>

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.070
Stink bug.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.940
It's a bat.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.030
I-It's not a bat.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.620
<i>It's a bat.</i>

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.080
Victory.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.090
That makes 30 losses in a row for you,
Ogata. Shall we continue?

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.050
<i>Sorry! I forgot you actually
suck at these games, Ogata!</i>

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:52.010
<i>Still, Ms. Kirisu is relishing
picking off Ogata every time.</i>

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:01.100
<i>This atmosphere isn't remotely friendly...</i>

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:02.810
Ogata.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:09.030
Everyone is cut out for certain things
and not for others.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:12.820
I'll get some coffee.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.750
Listen, Ogata...

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.550
Um, I don't know how to put this,

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:33.760
but the truth is, someone
cares about you more than you know.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.970
Maybe that person didn't
realize it either, but it can be hard

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:43.060
when you're not used
to admitting your feelings.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:47.530
I hope you can return those feelings.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.990
Y-You're talking about your—

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.990
About Ms. Kirisu.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:02.710
Well, she's awkward socially,
so it's easy to get the wrong idea.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.540
Honestly, she's warm and caring
when it comes to students.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:13.180
When you talk to me,
would you be clear about the subject?

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:17.760
Sorry!
But for you to critique my Japanese

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.810
shows you've really grown, Ogata!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.140
<i>Warm and caring about students?</i>

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.440
MODERN JAPANESE TEST - RIZU OGATA

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.480
<i>Ridiculous.</i>

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:30.480
<i>Give up.</i>

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.030
<i>I just don't see it.</i>

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.580
What is it, Ms. Kirisu?!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:40.410
Ow...

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.460
Hey!
What is it?!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.460
Th-Th-There...

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.670
Oh, the bug from before.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.220
I'll get it this time!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.300
Ms. Kirisu, would you move?

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.390
I-I can't!
I'm paralyzed with fear!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.060
<i>Seriously?!</i>

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.440
So this is what you meant
by warm and caring?

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:11.530
You've definitely got the wrong idea!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.870
Run!
Ogata, it's coming for you!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:22.830
Get away!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.210
Oh, Mr. Taro's here.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.550
SECRET RESTAURANT CODE
FOR COCKROACH

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.720
Problem?

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.090
N-No...

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.890
<i>The daughter of
a restaurant owner is tough.</i>

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:48.020
Well, I owe you my thanks, Ogata.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.190
That's okay.
You're a regular customer.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:54.820
And besides,
you helped me study, too.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:59.160
That reminds me.
You still haven't shaken yourself of the habit

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.410
of spacing out every time
you run into a difficult word.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.580
And you still intend to take
the humanities entrance exam?!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.500
I'm training to overcome that

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.960
by figuring the word out
from the context!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.290
I don't need you to tell me that!

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.380
In the first place, you're always so...

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.550
<i>Fail!</i>

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:16.720
<i>In the end, my plan to get them
to make up was a train wreck!</i>

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:24.270
I was a little surprised.

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:27.430
So Ms. Kirisu's weakness
is Mr. Taro, huh?

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.430
SECRET RESTAURANT CODE
FOR COCKROACH

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:32.150
Back then I didn't think
Ms. Kirisu even had a weakness.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.780
Or I guess I made no effort to know.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:39.570
<i>I have a feeling
she's got quite a few weaknesses.</i>

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.830
So maybe...

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:47.710
<i>Honestly, she's warm and caring
when it comes to students.</i>

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.460
Maybe she has even more sides to her

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:54.000
that I just never tried to see before.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.670
If you hadn't been around,

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:01.640
I'm sure I wouldn't have thought of that.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.600
<i>My strategy...</i>

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.980
<i>...may not have been
a total train wreck after all.</i>

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:16.440
By the way, Yuiga,
if Mr. Taro shows up at my house,

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:15.820
SECRET RESTAURANT CODE
FOR COCKROACH

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:19.030
will you come over to help?

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.700
Would there be a point to that?

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:25.740
From what I saw back there,
you're a professional at killing—

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.620
H-Huh? Did I say
something strange again?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:38.010
<i>Again?!</i>

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:38.010
A FEW DAYS LATER

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:38.010
CRACK

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.850
I'm fine, Nariyuki.

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.640
It's just a cold.
No big deal.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.940
What are you talking about?
Your fever's close to 40 degrees.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:51.940
Mom!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.100
Lie down!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:56.020
But you have to study,
don't you?

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.980
Never mind me.
Just lie down.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.070
Yeah!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.320
Lie down!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:05.200
I'll be the pinch-hitter
for today and do your job for you!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.410
Brother, you're so cool!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.950
You got that right!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.830
- Do that one more time!
- Your job for you!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.040
<i>Easier said than done...</i>

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:18.460
<i>I don't even know much
about Mom's job.</i>

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:24.300
<i>I believe it's around here.
The shop's called "Luxur Jelly."</i>

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.510
<i>Here?!</i>

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:34.650
I sure do appreciate
your help today, Nariyuki.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:36.560
We're short on staff.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.900
Is Hanae...
Your mother doing all right?

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.740
Y-yes. She said she'll be
back to work tomorrow.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.910
Oh, good to hear!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:51.620
But isn't it kind of awkward
for a male to be in here?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:56.210
It's fine! Most of our customers
are older women.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.550
In fact, they'll be pleased
to see a young man in here.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:00.340
Probably.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.550
Y-Yeah, but...

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:07.180
Oh, you're embarrassed!
How cute!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.970
All right!
Then let's do this!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:21.900
It's the mall mascot character,
Wankoro Hanako!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.030
Now you're not embarrassed, right?

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.490
<i>N-Now I'm embarrassed
for another reason!</i>

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.620
<i>My voice isn't coming out!</i>

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.950
Hello, Luxur Jelly.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.210
Oh, from my daughter's kindergarten!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.590
My daughter has a fever?!

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.960
Understood!
I'll be right there!

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.670
Sorry, Nariyuki!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.720
Just do as I instructed before!
I'm counting on you!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.600
Wait for me, daughter!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:56.020
<i>You wait, manager!</i>

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.560
<i>I don't believe this.
Hey...</i>

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.610
<i>Calm down, Nariyuki Yuiga.</i>

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:08.820
<i>Don't forget you're here
on Mom's behalf!</i>

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:13.200
<i>You could say the fate
of the Yuiga family is riding on me.</i>

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:17.250
<i>Even if it's a mistake and
I want to go home, I can't think like that!</i>

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.420
This shop carries a lot of cute large sizes too,

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.960
so I wanted
to bring you here, Rizurin.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.420
I appreciate it, Takemoto.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.380
<i>Let's go home.</i>

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.510
I just wish Fuminocchi
could've come with us.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:34.220
Well, she's got
a lot on her plate, too.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:38.940
<i>I can't do this.
There's just no way I can do this.</i>

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.980
<i>Everyone,
forgive your cowardly big brother.</i>

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.730
Excuse me!

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:51.160
Would you measure her cup size?

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:58.620
Sheesh! Growing out of
her bra at this late date!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.040
Just how big
are those jugs going to get?!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.630
T-Takemoto, lower your voice!

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.430
What's the difference?
There's only an employee here.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.430
<i>I didn't hear that!
I didn't hear that!</i>

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.180
<i>Since it's come to this,
I have no choice.</i>

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.470
<i>I'll take the head off
and explain the situation!</i>

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:23.900
<i>My hand can't reach the zipper!</i>

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.320
<i>I can't take it off!</i>

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.360
Oh, I get it!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:33.320
You must be new here, huh?

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.370
Then I can't blame you
for not knowing how to do it.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.540
<i>S-Saved...</i>

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.040
You don't have anything to worry about.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.000
Here.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.500
I'll help you do it.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.340
First, line the measuring tape
against her top

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.720
and try not to let it get crooked.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:01.770
<i>Nothing.
I feel nothing.</i>

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.980
<i>I'm just holding
a measuring tape, that's all!</i>

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.570
<i>I'm not thinking about
anything except the number!</i>

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.110
Whoa!
It says 91 centimeters!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.740
<i>Ninety-one...</i>

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:16.530
Next, from under...

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.290
<i>Ninety-one...</i>

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.630
What's wrong?

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.130
Maybe she's nervous
because she's not used to the job yet?

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.720
Um, excuse me.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.190
This sexy one...

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:46.690
And this elegant one...

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.940
Which one is more popular?

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:54.530
Or which one would
a third-year high school boy prefer?

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:00.910
Oh, it's not like I plan
on showing anybody though...

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.720
You recommend
the elegant one, huh?

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.720
Then maybe I'll get it.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.560
- That was a good buy, huh?
- Yes.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:27.980
Glad we stopped by.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:30.860
<i>I'm sorry, Takemoto.</i>

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.990
<i>I think a bit of
my own self-interest snuck in there...</i>

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:38.700
Excuse me.
Can I get a little help here?

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.910
<i>Ms. Kirisu!</i>

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:48.880
I'm kind of reluctant to ask you this...

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.880
Could you unhook me?

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:02.810
Um, it seems this size
doesn't fit me. It's too tight.

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:09.360
<i>Ms. Kirisu! I'm sorry! I'm not looking!
I just stole a glance!</i>

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:14.280
Hurry. All your fidgeting
is making me more embarrassed.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.830
Please hurry.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.000
<i>Wh-What is this? How is it
that I find myself in the changing room</i>

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.710
<i>of a lingerie shop,
unhooking my teacher's bra?!</i>

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:36.550
<i>H-Huh? I can't get it.</i>

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.390
<i>How does this work?!</i>

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:44.560
It's taking you a long time.
Don't tell me...

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.430
<i>D-Did she see through me?!</i>

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:54.980
Did I break this bra
by putting it on?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.530
<i>I'm safe!</i>

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:00.450
<i>I got it!</i>

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:03.910
Good.
Then it wasn't broken?

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:07.120
Thank you, you've been a big help.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:10.250
<i>Don't look this way!</i>

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:14.800
Oh no, the bra fell off.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.720
<i>I'm beat.</i>

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:26.680
<i>I didn't realize work was so hard.</i>

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:31.100
<i>Well, at least the odds are against
anyone else I know coming...</i>

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.570
<i>No, I'm beyond
being surprised.</i>

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.700
<i>All right!
It looks like those two left.</i>

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:46.790
<i>Ri, Uruka, I'm sorry
for turning down your invitation.</i>

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:51.330
<i>But I'm the type of person
who likes to choose underwear alone.</i>

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.920
<i>Or rather,
please understand!</i>

00:19:55.630 --> 00:20:01.010
<i>Choosing underwear
with you two amounts to torture!</i>

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:08.310
<i>So for today,
I can take my time, and by myself, too.</i>

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.520
Um, excuse me!

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:13.810
I'd like this, that,
and that one in size A!

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.270
Is it okay if I try them on?

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:21.650
Um...

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:27.830
Could I try the same style as this,
but also in size B and C?

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:31.040
I mean, I'm always size A...

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:36.130
But maybe...
maybe they've gotten bigger!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:40.340
I think it's always good
to look into the possibilities!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:44.300
Come on, possibilities,
I'm counting on you!

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:47.970
Sorry, Nariyuki!

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:51.270
Thanks for watching the shop for me!

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:54.190
I dropped my daughter off
at my parents' house.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.730
I bet you had a heck of a time,
not being able to get that off.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.530
It's A after all!

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:04.660
- I'll take these...
- You're all sweaty!

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.000
God is dead, Yuiga.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:18.040
Furuhashi! I-I can explain!

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:21.760
Your expression is blank!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.050
Pull yourself together!

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:57.940
DELICIOUS CREPERIE

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:10.280
Well, I understand
the circumstances, but...

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.740
You're just lucky
I'm the one who found out.

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:16.410
If it had been those two,
you'd really be in hot water right now.

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:19.830
Why?

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:22.460
I'm not telling you.

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:25.460
That's the fifth exercise
to understand a woman's heart!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:39.640
Next time: A Lost Lamb
in New Territory Encounters X.

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:39.980
NEXT EPISODE: A LOST LAMB
IN NEW TERRITORY
ENCOUNTERS X
